cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OCBC, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "OCBC: Open Controls Baseline Catalog"
abstract: >-
  OCBC is a machine-readable, cloud-agnostic security controls catalog. It
  merges the NIST SP 800-53 Rev. 5 control catalog with the SP 800-53B
  baseline profiles and the FedRAMP baselines, all read from their OSCAL
  JSON, and enriches every control with baseline membership flags, a derived
  severity level and a non-negotiable indicator. The catalog is regenerated
  daily and published as a single JSON file with a JSON Schema; the ocbc
  Python package downloads it or regenerates it from the official sources.
authors:
  - family-names: Sadayamuthu
    given-names: Karthikeyan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-3539-6048"
version: 0.1.1
date-released: "2026-11-03"
license: MIT
